      "\u001b[1;31mTypeError\u001b[0m: sum_num() takes 2 positional arguments but 3 were given"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "sum_num(2,3,4)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "3. `sum_num(2,3)`. value of `2` is passed to `x` and value of `3` is passed to `y`. Therefore within the instance of the function, `x=2` and `y=3`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "2 + 3 = 5\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
