    "#### *Lambda Functions*\n",
    "\n",
    "Lambda functions are akin to disposable emails that are offered by services such as tempmail.com. \n",
    "\n",
    "Essentially, lambda functions are annonymous i.e. no function names are provided, but rather the keyword `lambda` is used.\n",
    "\n",
    "Lambda functions are useful when you need a quick and simple function that can be used once or as an argument to another function."
